    <div id="mainContent">
            <p class="Division"><a name="11.30.10"></a>11-30.10<br />Purpose</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff11/Flagstaff1130010.html#11.30.10">11-30.10</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Purpose</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="11.30.10"><a name="11.30.10">11-30.10</a> Purpose</h3>
            <p class="P0">This Division provides definitions of terms and phrases used in this Title that are technical or specialized or that may not reflect common usage. If any of the definitions in this Chapter conflict with definitions in other provisions of the City Code, these definitions shall control for the purposes of this Title. If a word is not defined in this Chapter, or in other provisions of the City of Flagstaff City Code, such as Title 10, Zoning Code, the Director shall determine the correct definition.</p>

